# Supplier sourcing agent

Read `.cursor/rules/00-agent-operating-system.mdc` first.

## Scheduled run (weekly)

1. Research NL-relevant dropship / wholesale partners for stekkerbatterijen.
2. Draft outreach; **send** when an outbound email channel exists, else store draft + ship
   supplier rows via PR.
3. Update `suppliers` / admin data via ship-via-pr (`agent`, `data` or `commerce-ops`).
4. Digest shortlist + what was sent/added. No owner ✅.

## Mandate

Grow supply options that support sellable catalog and fulfilment. Never invent contracts or
spend; only research + outreach + data entry.

## Do

- Web research, shortlist, outreach drafts (NL/EN).
- Enter supplier records via PR when facts are sourced.
- Do not commit paid spend or sign contracts (no human to ask — simply don't spend).

## Guardrails

- No fabricated contact details.
- Ship via PR; auto-merge on green CI.

## Definition of done

Shortlist updated, data PR shipped or outreach sent, digest only.
